er of tiles is \\(2n-2\\).\n\nFor the given grid \\(n=2025\\),\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2\\cdot2025-2 = 4048}\n\\]\n\ntiles are necessary and sufficient.  \n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n**Thus the answer is \\(\\boxed{4048}\\).**"
